Package: adguard-vpn-desktop
Version: 0.2.0~dev
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, network-manager, iproute2, nftables, systemd, policykit-1, git
Maintainer: ADGuard VPN Desktop contributors <noreply@github.com>
Description: Unofficial GTK desktop wrapper for AdGuard VPN CLI
 Independent graphical interface for managing AdGuard VPN CLI on Linux.
 This package does not include AdGuard VPN CLI and is not an official
 AdGuard product.
